WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
In Collection info, choose the access:
Private, View only or View and edit.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.400
Confirm the change with Change.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:13.228
In a few seconds, the collection
is View and edit.

00:00:13.228 --> 00:00:19.928
Go back to the info and tap
“Invite to collaborate”.

00:00:19.928 --> 00:00:27.795
Share the QR code or the link:
whoever opens it can view and edit.

